<title>NIGERIA: NIGERIA'S AFRIBANK H1 NET JUMPS HIGHER.</title>
<headline>NIGERIA'S AFRIBANK H1 NET JUMPS HIGHER.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result to end-June 1997 for Afribank Nigeria Plc published on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				 (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1997	  1996</p>
<p> Gross income		2,199   vs 2,192</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    254   vs   100</p>
<p> Taxation			 82   vs    30</p>
<p> Profit after taxation     172   vs    70</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
